This subpackage (pycse.sklearn.zenn) is an independent JAX/Flax implementation
of ZENN (Zentropy-Enhanced Neural Network), written for pycse from the
method described in the paper below. It is not a copy of the authors' code.

Paper:
  Wang, S.; Shang, S.-L.; Liu, Z.-K.; Hao, W. (2026).
  "ZENN: A thermodynamics-inspired computational framework for
  heterogeneous data-driven modeling."
  Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences 123(1): e2511227122.
  doi:10.1073/pnas.2511227122

